     "nota": "Short = you move (Han gik **ud**). Long = you're there (Han er **ude**). With der-/her-: **derop**, **derhenne**, **herhjemme**.",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "ned i or nede i",
     "texto": [
      "With a preposition the difference shows too:\n\n- **ned i** skolegården = go down **to** the yard (you go from one place to another)\n- **nede i** skolegården = **in** the yard (you move around inside it)\n\nAnd they can combine with **der-** / **her-**: **derop** (up there, over there), **derhenne** (there), **herhjemme** (here at home)."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    }
